Original 20 x 10 x 6 mm box with coplanar side faces split at Z=2 mm,
generated by tools/generate-analysis-height-split-box.py with OCCT 7.9.3.1.
Export preserves the split face uses; no same-domain simplification is applied.
Fixture provenance does not establish geometry or mechanical qualification.
